stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> submitting
    submitting --> pending: prediction 已创建
    submitting --> running: provider 已开始
    submitting --> rendering_demo: 配额耗尽或明确可降级错误
    submitting --> submission_unknown: 创建结果不明确
    submitting --> failed: 输入或安全拒绝

    pending --> running: provider processing
    pending --> saving: Webhook succeeded
    running --> saving: Webhook succeeded
    pending --> rendering_demo: provider 明确失败且允许降级
    running --> rendering_demo: provider 明确失败且允许降级
    pending --> failed: 安全拒绝
    running --> failed: 安全拒绝

    rendering_demo --> saving: FFmpeg 输出完成
    rendering_demo --> failed: 本地重试耗尽
    saving --> saving: 下载 转码或 R2 写入重试
    saving --> succeeded: 私有 R2 输出已保存
    saving --> failed: Worker 重试耗尽

    submission_unknown --> pending: 可靠 Webhook 确认创建
    submission_unknown --> running: 可靠 Webhook 确认运行
    submission_unknown --> saving: 可靠 Webhook 确认成功
    submission_unknown --> failed: 人工确认未创建或失败

    succeeded --> expired: 到达二十四小时
    failed --> expired: 到达清理时间
    canceled --> expired: 到达清理时间
    expired --> [*]

    note right of submission_unknown
        不自动重提
        不自动降级
        保持额度预留
    end note

    note right of rendering_demo
        不调用外部模型
        只允许重试本地处理
    end note

